DOMAIN-SUFFIX,login.onstove.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,member.onstove.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,payco.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,naver.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,daum.net

# === Patch / Download / 資源伺服器 ===
